    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A comprehensive analysis of sewage collected from 74 cities in 60 countries - including Pakistan, Kenya, Tanzania, and Uganda - has yielded the first comparable global database of antimicrobial resistant (AMR) bacteria that are present in mainly healthy people in these countries.",
